  "title": "ISic030004. Lead defixio",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: <a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/isicily/items/SEW88NC7\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/isicily/items/SEW88NC7</a></div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <span class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"aba\">face a</span>  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"diva--interpretive\">  <a id=\"aa-l1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>τὰν Ε(i.e. ὐ)κλέος γλο͂σαν κ-<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>αὶ τὰν Ἀριστοφάνιος <span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>καὶ τὰ̣ν Ἀνγείλιος κα-<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ὶ τ[ὰν] Ἀλκ[ί]φρο̣νο[ς] κ-<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>αὶ τὰν Ͱαγεστράτο̄ τ̣ο͂-<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ν συνδίϙο̄ν τ̣ο͂ν̣ [Ε]ὐ[κ]λί-<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l7-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>ος κα[ὶ τ]ο͂ν̣ Ἀριστοφάνε-<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l8-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span>ος [τὰς γ]λό̄[σ]ας κα[ὶ τ]ὰν <span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l9-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 4.</span>]λ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">.</span>]ονος [γλο͂σαν] <span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span></span></div>  <span class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"abb\">face b</span>  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"divb--interpretive\">  <a id=\"ab-l1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>καὶ τὰν Ο[ἰ]νο̣[θ]έ̣ο̄ καὶ τ-<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"ab-l2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ὰν Α̣[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">...</span>γ]λ̣ο͂[σ]αν <span class=\"tei text-direction r-to-l\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;←</span></span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: <a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/isicily/items/SEW88NC7\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/isicily/items/SEW88NC7</a></div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"aba\">face a</span><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"diva--diplomatic\"><a id=\"aa-l1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>ΤΑΝΕ(i.e. Υ)ΚΛΕΟΣΓΛΟΣΑΝΚ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΑΙΤΑΝΑΡΙΣΤΟΦΑΝΙΟΣ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΚΑΙΤ.ΝΑΝΓΕΙΛΙΟΣΚΑ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ΙΤ[..]ΑΛΚ[.]ΦΡ.ΝΟ[.]Κ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΑΙΤΑΝͰΑΓΕΣΤΡΑΤΟ̄.Ο<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ΝΣΥΝΔΙϘΟ̄Ν.Ο.[.]Υ[.]ΛΙ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>ΟΣΚΑ[..]Ο.ΑΡΙΣΤΟΦΑΝΕ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span>ΟΣ[....]ΛΟ̄[.]ΑΣΚΑ[..]ΑΝ<span class=\"tei text-d