      "html": "<span class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"aba\">face a</span><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"diva--diplomatic\"><a id=\"aa-l1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>ΤΑΝΕ(i.e. Υ)ΚΛΕΟΣΓΛΟΣΑΝΚ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΑΙΤΑΝΑΡΙΣΤΟΦΑΝΙΟΣ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΚΑΙΤ.ΝΑΝΓΕΙΛΙΟΣΚΑ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ΙΤ[..]ΑΛΚ[.]ΦΡ.ΝΟ[.]Κ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΑΙΤΑΝͰΑΓΕΣΤΡΑΤΟ̄.Ο<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ΝΣΥΝΔΙϘΟ̄Ν.Ο.[.]Υ[.]ΛΙ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>ΟΣΚΑ[..]Ο.ΑΡΙΣΤΟΦΑΝΕ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span>ΟΣ[....]ΛΟ̄[.]ΑΣΚΑ[..]ΑΝ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"aa-l9-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">····</span>]Λ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">·</span>]ΟΝΟΣ[.......]<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span></span></div><span class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"abb\">face b</span><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"divb--diplomatic\"><a id=\"ab-l1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>ΚΑΙΤΑΝΟ[.]Ν.[.].Ο̄ΚΑΙΤ<span class=\"tei text-direction l-to-r\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;→</span><br id=\"ab-l2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΑΝ.[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">···</span>.].Ο[.]ΑΝ<span class=\"te